guide forever/horde/orc-troll/01-durotar
title Durotar
faction Horde
race Orc,Troll
levels 1-12
zone Durotar
next forever/horde/orc-troll/02-the-barrens

# Route: the simulator's consensus Orc route (data/sim/export/consensus-horde-orc,
# visit 1, Durotar 1-11.8). Trolls start in the same valley and share it.
# Checked against the 2026-10-14 export: same Durotar quests (it drops only
# the enchanters' A Pain in the Neck, kept here as optional); its order goes
# from Tiragarde Keep straight to Sen'jin, but its Durotar visit takes 3.26 h
# against 3.27 h for the one this guide was built from, so the order stays.
#
# Flow: Valley of Trials -> Sen'jin Village (report) -> Razor Hill (bind) ->
# Razormane Grounds -> Tiragarde Keep -> Razor Hill -> Rezlak, Drygulch Ravine
# and Thunder Ridge -> hearth -> the wreckage and the coast -> Sen'jin Village ->
# Echo Isles and the south-east shore -> Kolkar Crag -> Razor Hill -> Fizzle
# Darkstorm -> Razor Hill -> Heglan's shore, the naga coast, Margoz and Skull
# Rock -> Razor Hill -> west over the Southfury River to Far Watch Post and the
# Crossroads (flight path, bind). The Barrens guide starts at the Crossroads.
#
# Local order fixed by hand (same quest set as the export unless listed below):
# - Cutting Teeth (788) is turned in as soon as the boars are done, with the
#   class letters and Wayward Weapons, so Sting of the Scorpid (789) and
#   Galgar's Cactus Apple Surprise (4402), which need 788, are carried to
#   Sarkoth: his slope is full of Scorpid Workers and cactuses. All three go
#   back to the Den with Sarkoth (804); 0.01 h faster to 10 and 20 under the
#   simulator than taking 789 and 4402 after Sarkoth.
# - Vile Familiars (792; 1485/1499 for Warlocks) is handed in and Burning
#   Blade Medallion (794) taken before the Burning Blade Coven, so Thazz'ril's
#   Pick (6394) and Yarrog are done on one trip into the cave; the export goes
#   in for the pick, back to the Den and in again for Yarrog. 37-50 s faster
#   to 10 and 20 under the simulator (Orc; any class, Mage, Warlock, Shaman),
#   which does not count the second walk through the cave.
# - Legging It (96821) is taken at Sen'jin on the first visit: its spiders sit
#   on the road north to Razor Hill, where Gar'Thok takes it.
# - Rezlak's second pair (A Simmering Storm 97281, Stormy Potential 97282) and
#   Lost But Not Forgotten (816) are done on the first Thunder Ridge visit at
#   about 8.5 instead of a second trip there at 11: the orb drops from the
#   Storm Witches you already kill, and the lizards and Misha are next door.
# - A Missing Hand / Threat from Below (99048, 99049) and Conscript of the
#   Horde (840) are taken at Razor Hill at 10.5, when Orgnil and Takrin
#   first offer them; the naga coast is done on the way to Margoz.
# - Threat from Below (99051) is now taken from Orgnil after 99049's turn-in,
#   with a second short loop to the naga beach before leaving Razor Hill.
# - Conscript of the Horde (840) is turned in at Far Watch Post on the way to
#   the Crossroads (the export turns it in on a later pass); Crossroads
#   Conscription (842) goes to Sergra in the Barrens guide.
# - A Pain in the Neck (96873) is for enchanters: Pa'zula's Luminous Residue
#   comes from disenchanting the Hexed Pendants the Echo Isles trolls drop.
#   Taken at Sen'jin, done on the isles and handed in on the way back.
# - Threat from Below (99052, Forever, optional): Orgnil's last naga quest,
#   Aggor the Young on the north coast. Aggor is elite, so the simulator
#   leaves it out; it is offered at the last Razor Hill stop for groups.
#
# Class quests: Warlocks do Ruzan's Vile Familiars (1485, 1499) instead of
# Zureetha's. Shamans take Call of Earth (1516-1518) from Canaga Earthcaller
# at 4: the Felstalker hooves come from the slope below the Burning Blade
# cave, Spirit Rock is just south of the Den. At 10 in Razor Hill: Warriors
# take Veteran Uzzek (1505) and do Path of Defense (1498) at Far Watch Post on
# the way out (Thun'grim 1502 and Forged Steel 1503 follow in the Barrens
# guide); Shamans take Call of Fire (2983), continued in the Barrens guide;
# Hunters take Etched Parchment (3087, Orcs) or Etched Tablet (3082, Trolls)
# to Jen'shan at 1, tame their three beasts for Thotar (6062, 6083, 6082:
# Tame Beast) around Razor Hill and hand Training the Beast (6081, Beast
# Training) to Ormak Grimshot on a short trip into Orgrimmar before leaving
# Durotar (moved from Silverpine at 16: Forever's 6081 now teaches Beast
# Training); Warlocks take Gan'rul's Summons (1506) from Ophek and get the
# Voidwalker (1501, 1504) on two short trips into Orgrimmar, whose gate is a
# few steps from Skull Rock; Troll Priests take Hex of Weakness (5654) from
# Tai'jin, handed to Ur'kyo in Orgrimmar at about 16. The Shattered Hand
# (1963, Rogue) teaches no spell and is left out. In Favor of Spirituality /
# Garments of Spirituality (5649, 5648, Troll Priest) reward a robe, not a
# spell: not taken. Mages read their letter from Gornek (98576 Orc, 3086
# Troll) and hand it to Mai'ah at the Den. Ju-Ju Heaps (1884), their level 10
# quest, opens after the route's Echo Isles visit at about 8: see
# forever/class/mage/ju-ju-heaps.
# Class letters: every class's level 1 letter from Gornek (2383/3065 Warrior,
# 3087/3082 Hunter, 3088/3083 Rogue, 3085 Troll Priest, 3089/3084 Shaman,
# 98576/3086 Mage, 3090/98575 Warlock; Orc/Troll) is taken at the Den and
# handed to the trainer beside it.
#
# Left out: the export's Orgrimmar stop at 11.8-12.5: Neeru Fireblade (829),
# The Admiral's Orders (831, Nazgrel), Burning Shadows (832) and Ak'Zeloth
# (809, to Far Watch Post, then The Demon Seed 924), plus the city's Forever
# cooking errands (97326, 97246, 97249, 97242, 97275). The export goes from
# Orgrimmar to the zeppelin for Silverpine; this route goes west to the
# Barrens, so the city is a detour. Tried after Skull Rock and again before
# Far Watch Post: 0.07-0.10 h slower to level 20 under the simulator. The
# cooking errands are done in Orgrimmar at about 19 in
# forever/horde/03-silverpine-forest at full XP, and Burning Shadows (832) is
# carried there too. Need for a Cure (812) and Finding the Antidote (813):
# the export never finishes them.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Valley of Trials

step Kaltunk
  accept 4641                         -- Kaltunk, where you start

step Gornek
  tip Gornek waits inside the Den, the building just west of Kaltunk.
  turnin 4641
  accept 788
  accept 97279

# The Den is a cave: Gornek stands just inside its mouth, Kzan Thornslash
# "behind me in the Den" (Gornek in Wayward Weapons, 97279,
# https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=97279/wayward-weapons), "all the way
# back in the back of the cave" (https://www.wowhead.com/classic/npc=3159,
# comments), and Mai'ah, the mage trainer, at 42.51,69.04 "near the entrance
# to the Den" (Glyphic Parchment, 98576). The mouth, 42.4,68.6, lies between
# her and Gornek (42.06,68.33) and opens east onto the training grounds; from
# the boars or from Hana'zua a straight line to anyone inside crosses the
# hill, so the steps before each Den visit end at the mouth.
step Training weapons and boars
  tip The weapons lie around the Den and the training grounds; the Mottled Boars roam the whole valley floor.
  collect 277653 quest 97279.1
  kill 3098 quest 788.1
  goto 42.4,68.6 "The Den"

step The Den
  tip Gornek stands just inside the cave mouth; Kzan Thornslash at the back of the cave behind him.
  turnin 788                          -- Gornek
  accept 2383 only Orc,Warrior        -- Gornek: Simple Parchment
  accept 3065 only Troll,Warrior      -- Gornek: Simple Tablet
  accept 3087 only Orc,Hunter         -- Gornek: Etched Parchment
  accept 3082 only Troll,Hunter       -- Gornek: Etched Tablet
  accept 3088 only Orc,Rogue          -- Gornek: Encrypted Parchment
  accept 3083 only Troll,Rogue        -- Gornek: Encrypted Tablet
  accept 3085 only Troll,Priest       -- Gornek: Hallowed Tablet
  accept 3089 only Orc,Shaman         -- Gornek: Rune-Inscribed Parchment
  accept 3084 only Troll,Shaman       -- Gornek: Rune-Inscribed Tablet
  accept 98576 only Orc,Mage          -- Gornek: Glyphic Parchment
  accept 3086 only Troll,Mage         -- Gornek: Glyphic Tablet
  accept 3090 only Orc,Warlock        -- Gornek: Tainted Parchment
  accept 98575 only Troll,Warlock     -- Gornek: Tainted Tablet
  accept 789                          -- Gornek
  turnin 97279                        -- Kzan Thornslash, at the back of the cave
  turnin 3090 only Orc,Warlock        -- Nartok, the warlock trainer at the back of the cave
  turnin 98575 only Troll,Warlock     -- Nartok
  turnin 3088 only Orc,Rogue          -- Rwag, the rogue trainer in the Den
  turnin 3083 only Troll,Rogue        -- Rwag
  turnin 2383 only Orc,Warrior        -- Frang, the warrior trainer beside the Den
  turnin 3065 only Troll,Warrior      -- Frang
  turnin 3087 only Orc,Hunter         -- Jen'shan, the hunter trainer beside the Den
  turnin 3082 only Troll,Hunter       -- Jen'shan
  turnin 3085 only Troll,Priest       -- Ken'jai, the priest trainer at the Den
  turnin 3089 only Orc,Shaman         -- Shikrik, the shaman trainer beside the Den
  turnin 3084 only Troll,Shaman       -- Shikrik
  turnin 98576 only Orc,Mage          -- Mai'ah, the mage trainer, at the entrance to the Den
  turnin 3086 only Troll,Mage         -- Mai'ah
  accept 4402                         -- Galgar, by the cooking fire
  accept 792 only !Warlock            -- Zureetha Fargaze
  accept 1485 only Warlock            -- Ruzan
