# The Burning Blade Coven's mouth: "Go in the cave (45 56) and stay right"
# (https://www.wowhead.com/classic/quest=794, comments); the pick lies past the
# first split, straight on, then right along the stream to the waterfall
# (https://www.wowhead.com/classic/quest=6394, comments).
step Burning Blade Coven
  goto 45.0,56.0 "Burning Blade Coven"

step Thazz'ril's Pick
  tip Inside the cave, go straight on at the first split, then right and follow the stream on your left to the waterfall: the pick glows by the water, behind a column of rock.
  collect 16332 quest 6394.1 @43.7,53.8

step Yarrog Baneshadow
  tip Inside the cave, keep to the right wall all the way round, over the stream: Yarrog waits at the end.
  collect 4859 quest 794.1

step Felstalker hooves
  only Shaman
  tip Felstalkers roam the slope below the cave, on the valley's north side.
  collect 6640 quest 1516.1

