step Call of Earth
  only Shaman
  tip Canaga stands outside the Den. Spirit Rock is the hill just south of it: drink the Earth Sapta there to see the Minor Manifestation of Earth, then take the Rough Quartz back to Canaga.
  turnin 1516                         -- Canaga Earthcaller
  accept 1517
  turnin 1517                         -- Minor Manifestation of Earth, on Spirit Rock
  accept 1518
  turnin 1518                         -- Canaga Earthcaller: Stoneskin Totem and your Earth Totem

step Ukor
  tip Ukor stands on the road at the valley's eastern exit.
  accept 2161

